WEBVTT

01:40.050 --> 01:42.979
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.140 --> 01:45.979
[Episode 27]

02:09.800 --> 02:10.690
Wen Xiao.

02:11.200 --> 02:13.430
What a ridiculous farce!

02:14.030 --> 02:17.430
It was already utterly foolish for Bingyi's descendant

02:17.550 --> 02:20.700
to choose self-sacrifice.

02:21.020 --> 02:25.510
And the evil demon, who was destined to be killed by him,

02:25.660 --> 02:28.090
was actually willing

02:28.120 --> 02:30.520
to be frozen solid with him.

02:33.680 --> 02:34.610
I'm willing too.

02:35.790 --> 02:37.560
But I'm not strong enough.

02:39.030 --> 02:41.960
I'm always not strong enough. I hate myself for that.

02:47.150 --> 02:48.270
My master.

02:53.470 --> 02:54.970
My best friend.

03:01.570 --> 03:03.270
My beloved.

03:09.360 --> 03:12.180
They died in front of me one by one.

03:14.980 --> 03:16.850
All I could do…

03:20.730 --> 03:22.160
was watch helplessly.

04:42.070 --> 04:43.750
It turns out

04:43.920 --> 04:46.420
you're all fools.

04:47.390 --> 04:49.800
Thousands of years have passed.

04:50.990 --> 04:53.950
The remains of my soul

04:54.470 --> 04:57.010
are already fading.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.070
I didn't expect

04:59.710 --> 05:02.870
to witness such ridiculous

05:03.370 --> 05:06.020
yet sincere bonds.

05:07.630 --> 05:11.400
You're making this old soul of mine

05:12.290 --> 05:15.520
miss the vibrant

05:16.070 --> 05:18.920
mortal world.

05:38.270 --> 05:39.230
Open it.

06:00.470 --> 06:01.510
Dried flowers?

06:03.150 --> 06:05.480
Mr. Zhuo intentionally left them behind.

06:06.130 --> 06:08.210
They must be a useful clue.

06:11.300 --> 06:12.270
Useless.

06:13.860 --> 06:14.840
Useless?

06:16.850 --> 06:18.980
He got these useless dried flowers

06:21.430 --> 06:23.010
on his birthday

06:25.690 --> 06:26.990
many years ago.

06:28.700 --> 06:30.620
I didn't know it was his birthday

06:31.500 --> 06:32.980
and didn't prepare a gift.

06:35.210 --> 06:37.560
So I randomly picked some flowers

06:38.950 --> 06:41.130
outside the Demon Hunting Bureau

06:42.409 --> 06:43.540
and gave them to him.

06:48.060 --> 06:50.190
I didn't expect him to still keep them.

07:16.240 --> 07:17.430
My name is Wen Xiao.

07:19.820 --> 07:21.080
In terms of seniority,

07:21.120 --> 07:22.900
you should call me Aunt.

07:28.270 --> 07:29.550
I'm glad to meet you.

07:30.170 --> 07:32.420
I heard that today is your birthday.

07:34.460 --> 07:35.820
You're in mourning

07:35.840 --> 07:37.260
and can't celebrate it.

07:37.760 --> 07:39.200
As your elder,

07:40.600 --> 07:42.530
I'll give you

07:42.550 --> 07:43.300
a small gift.

07:46.370 --> 07:47.500
Wild flowers?

07:47.710 --> 07:48.750
No!

07:49.480 --> 07:50.720
How rude.

07:51.300 --> 07:53.760
These are holy flowers from the Wilderness,

07:53.790 --> 07:54.940
known as Zhi Chu.

07:55.870 --> 07:58.270
They can make people forget their worries.

08:00.070 --> 08:01.260
Zhi Chu…

08:03.360 --> 08:05.390
Can they really make people forget

08:05.630 --> 08:07.230
their worries and troubles?

08:10.160 --> 08:10.900
Well,

08:11.260 --> 08:12.400
actually,

08:12.790 --> 08:14.500
only you can free yourself

08:14.860 --> 08:15.950
from worry.

08:17.330 --> 08:18.420
The book says

08:19.320 --> 08:20.620
all life is suffering;

08:21.220 --> 08:23.280
you can only find relief in yourself.

08:37.809 --> 08:39.650
All life is suffering.

08:40.100 --> 08:41.429
You can only find relief

08:41.870 --> 08:43.340
in yourself.

08:44.020 --> 08:44.750
Yes.

08:45.900 --> 08:46.870
So,

08:48.040 --> 08:50.400
I hope you can stop dwelling in misery

08:50.420 --> 08:51.550
and sadness.

08:58.910 --> 08:59.950
Besides,

09:00.290 --> 09:02.790
I noticed you always wore dark blue.

09:03.260 --> 09:04.910
The color of these flowers

09:04.930 --> 09:06.510
goes very well with you.

09:06.810 --> 09:07.730
So beautiful.

09:10.390 --> 09:12.110
But I'm wearing…

09:14.950 --> 09:16.670
white ramie now.

09:18.820 --> 09:20.950
You won't always wear white.

09:23.360 --> 09:25.220
Just like the snow out the window.

09:26.190 --> 09:27.450
It'll eventually stop

09:28.210 --> 09:29.440
and melt.

09:31.490 --> 09:33.220
When flowers bloom on the hill,

09:34.530 --> 09:37.460
the view out the window will definitely be colorful.

09:47.790 --> 09:49.450
Everything I want to tell you…

09:52.520 --> 09:53.920
has been written in it.

09:56.700 --> 09:58.270
Read it, and you'll know.

10:01.840 --> 10:03.160
Zhuo…

10:05.820 --> 10:07.440
He was a fool.

10:08.690 --> 10:10.110
He was too foolish.

10:11.810 --> 10:12.630
At that time,

10:12.630 --> 10:13.740
I told him…

10:13.770 --> 10:15.630
Just like the snow out the window.

10:15.840 --> 10:17.640
The snow will eventually stop…

10:17.670 --> 10:18.870
It'll eventually stop…

10:18.870 --> 10:19.980
and melt.

10:20.000 --> 10:21.580
and melt.

10:23.210 --> 10:25.650
The world won't always be white.

10:25.710 --> 10:27.440
When flowers bloom on the hill,

10:27.590 --> 10:30.520
the view out the window will definitely be colorful.

10:32.500 --> 10:33.970
But now...

10:34.040 --> 10:35.080
Look at him.

10:38.630 --> 10:39.970
Look at him!

10:41.050 --> 10:42.460
Look at him.

10:57.320 --> 10:59.790
In the past thousands of years,

11:00.030 --> 11:02.670
many demons and humans

11:02.750 --> 11:04.310
have come here.

11:04.990 --> 11:07.170
But only you guys

11:07.270 --> 11:09.870
shocked and surprised me.

11:11.830 --> 11:13.230
So,

11:13.550 --> 11:16.080
I'm willing to give that boy

11:16.110 --> 11:19.040
and that great demon another chance.

11:19.590 --> 11:21.680
Within my soul

11:21.710 --> 11:24.700
lies a realm of illusions

11:24.920 --> 11:27.560
that can glimpse into the past

11:28.470 --> 11:30.590
and foresee the future.

11:32.680 --> 11:34.290
If he can pass the test,

11:34.350 --> 11:36.020
I'll save him.

11:37.250 --> 11:38.610
Are you

11:38.790 --> 11:40.750
willing to wait?

12:03.590 --> 12:04.630
Bingyi.

12:05.830 --> 12:08.360
You've been thinking about it for seven days.

12:09.110 --> 12:10.310
Any results?

12:21.080 --> 12:22.930
Why does it have to be me?

12:24.930 --> 12:26.620
Because in the whole world,

12:28.330 --> 12:29.810
only you can do it.

12:31.840 --> 12:33.070
But you'll die.

12:41.030 --> 12:42.430
If the world can be saved,

12:43.610 --> 12:45.140
I'm willing to do it

12:46.040 --> 12:47.810
and don't mind dying.

12:51.660 --> 12:52.690
Ying Long.

12:54.790 --> 12:57.420
You endured the pain of breaking your bones and horns

12:57.420 --> 12:58.630
to forge this sword.

13:00.920 --> 13:02.630
You gave this sword to me

13:04.450 --> 13:06.210
and fought alongside me

13:07.370 --> 13:08.690
to kill demons.

13:13.430 --> 13:14.550
I can't do it.

13:19.220 --> 13:20.820
The cloud sword is like a bone

13:21.630 --> 13:23.030
attached to your left arm

13:23.510 --> 13:24.840
to give you protection.

13:25.510 --> 13:26.970
The light sword

13:27.890 --> 13:29.310
is like a sharp horn

13:30.550 --> 13:32.210
that can kill enemies for you.

13:34.100 --> 13:35.500
It can cut clouds

13:36.220 --> 13:37.840
and give off light.

13:38.510 --> 13:40.370
That's why this sword is called

13:40.970 --> 13:42.020
Cloud Light.

13:44.490 --> 13:46.000
But you're not my enemy.

13:51.110 --> 13:52.680
If the one who wields this sword

13:52.680 --> 13:53.990
has to be me,

13:55.210 --> 13:56.830
I don't understand

13:59.740 --> 14:01.470
why I need to hold it against you

14:03.800 --> 14:06.860
while there are so many other demons in the Wilderness.

14:08.460 --> 14:09.990
After the great war,

14:10.500 --> 14:12.170
time and space were thrown into chaos,

14:12.170 --> 14:13.960
and the world collapsed.

14:14.130 --> 14:15.790
Look at the night sky.

14:16.150 --> 14:17.760
It's dark,

14:18.150 --> 14:19.860
devoid of stars and the moon.

14:21.750 --> 14:23.220
Such a world…

14:26.320 --> 14:27.990
makes me really sad.

14:29.570 --> 14:31.140
If it can't be restored…

14:34.250 --> 14:36.190
the Wilderness and the mortal world

14:36.190 --> 14:38.500
will be doomed.

14:39.270 --> 14:41.910
I should contribute my last bit of power.

14:45.330 --> 14:47.270
But how can the dark sky

14:48.940 --> 14:50.470
be starry

14:51.200 --> 14:52.560
and splendid again?

14:55.760 --> 14:57.730
I have the power of creation,

14:58.440 --> 15:00.360
so I should sacrifice my life

15:00.910 --> 15:02.150
and become stars.

15:04.310 --> 15:05.810
It's my duty

15:07.270 --> 15:08.980
and honor.

15:11.430 --> 15:13.280
Once one star is lit,

15:14.000 --> 15:15.660
all stars will begin to shine.

15:23.470 --> 15:25.670
Just let me be the first star.

15:30.610 --> 15:33.410
The Cloud Light Sword is meant for both protection

15:33.630 --> 15:34.930
and killing.

15:35.610 --> 15:37.010
Only by killing me with it

15:38.320 --> 15:40.870
can all living beings in the world be saved.

18:36.890 --> 18:38.620
One should follow one's heart…

18:41.420 --> 18:44.150
but forcing my best friend to kill me

18:46.110 --> 18:47.980
is too cruel.

18:51.720 --> 18:53.200
I'll do it myself.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.040
Remember.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.710
This is my choice,

19:49.890 --> 19:50.990
not yours.

19:53.040 --> 19:55.890
You don't have to bear any blame

19:55.950 --> 19:57.300
or guilt.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.990
I didn't expect you

20:39.080 --> 20:42.680
to pass my test.

20:49.390 --> 20:50.650
It was a test?

20:52.850 --> 20:54.740
Your choice

20:54.870 --> 20:57.840
was the same as my choice back then.

20:58.000 --> 20:58.910
Otherwise,

20:58.940 --> 21:02.650
you'd have to stay in the realm of illusions forever.

21:04.210 --> 21:06.070
Luckily, I made the right choice.

21:07.070 --> 21:08.580
Otherwise, I'd have to stay here forever

21:08.580 --> 21:10.110
and listen to your nagging.

21:12.510 --> 21:15.240
It turns out that the talkative one was not Bingyi

21:15.360 --> 21:16.590
but Ying Long.

21:18.190 --> 21:20.480
I chose to kill myself

21:20.630 --> 21:22.610
and become stars.

21:22.710 --> 21:24.810
It was my fate.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.910
Protecting the world

21:27.940 --> 21:29.950
with his sword until he died

21:30.110 --> 21:31.870
was his fate.

21:33.350 --> 21:35.010
Both he and I

21:35.510 --> 21:38.020
seemed miserable,

21:38.550 --> 21:41.280
but neither of us had any regrets.

21:41.880 --> 21:43.710
Then we are indeed alike.

21:45.510 --> 21:47.050
We both wanted to die

21:48.680 --> 21:51.110
but didn't want our friends to die for us.

21:52.170 --> 21:54.820
But Bingyi was soft-hearted.

21:55.250 --> 21:58.750
He used a drop of his blood between his eyebrows

21:58.790 --> 22:02.980
to extract a shred of my soul.

22:03.480 --> 22:06.370
He then attached it to that dragon bone

22:06.420 --> 22:10.670
and sealed it in the forbidden area of the Bingyi Clan.

22:15.240 --> 22:16.780
People in his clan

22:19.070 --> 22:20.400
were all soft-hearted.

22:23.470 --> 22:25.750
But unfortunately,

22:27.140 --> 22:28.730
you must have seen

22:28.980 --> 22:32.510
your future just now.

22:33.590 --> 22:34.470
Future?

22:36.480 --> 22:37.540
Oh?

22:38.530 --> 22:40.150
So

22:40.360 --> 22:43.290
Zhuo Yichen saw the future,

22:43.540 --> 22:44.910
and you saw

22:45.240 --> 22:47.040
the past.

22:51.920 --> 22:54.250
Although I didn't see the future,

22:56.560 --> 22:58.590
I can guess what it's like.

22:59.350 --> 23:01.900
It's not what you want,

23:02.010 --> 23:04.660
but that day will eventually come.

23:05.270 --> 23:08.450
Just like the fate of Bingyi and me.

23:09.240 --> 23:11.640
You two

23:11.960 --> 23:14.180
are really like us.

23:27.520 --> 23:28.750
Long time no see.

23:32.220 --> 23:33.530
Long time no see.

23:43.730 --> 23:45.130
Do you understand

23:45.800 --> 23:47.080
the illusion just now?

25:15.300 --> 25:16.870
You understand

25:17.470 --> 25:19.330
the illusion just now, don't you?

25:20.320 --> 25:21.480
Yes.

25:26.810 --> 25:29.270
Ying Long wasn't killed by Bingyi.

25:31.040 --> 25:32.790
He chose to die himself.

25:35.080 --> 25:36.800
But for thousands of years,

25:37.390 --> 25:39.120
some people have believed that

25:39.280 --> 25:41.450
Ying Long lost his sanity

25:42.220 --> 25:43.670
and destroyed the world.

25:43.980 --> 25:45.570
Bingyi killed him,

25:46.240 --> 25:47.570
and it served him right.

25:49.000 --> 25:50.110
In this world,

25:52.240 --> 25:54.770
lies and truth have always coexisted,

25:55.870 --> 25:57.640
just like good and evil,

25:57.980 --> 25:59.070
day and night.

26:00.200 --> 26:02.460
People always say demons are heartless.

26:02.870 --> 26:03.840
But Ying Long

26:04.530 --> 26:06.340
was righteous and selfless.

26:07.200 --> 26:08.320
He didn't want

26:08.350 --> 26:09.600
to go down in history.

26:10.510 --> 26:12.730
He only wished to become dim starlight

26:13.380 --> 26:15.310
and pierce through the dark night.

26:17.250 --> 26:18.560
So,

26:20.680 --> 26:22.120
being a demon

26:23.630 --> 26:25.240
or a human

26:26.670 --> 26:28.600
is merely a matter of title

26:29.860 --> 26:31.500
and identity.

26:35.440 --> 26:37.360
Just become

26:39.280 --> 26:40.720
who you want to be.

26:43.850 --> 26:46.450
As Bingyi's descendent,

26:47.350 --> 26:49.780
you inherited his power.

26:50.390 --> 26:53.080
So you should always remember that

26:53.110 --> 26:55.880
the Cloud Light Sword is not meant for killing

26:55.920 --> 26:58.280
but for protection.

26:58.480 --> 27:02.260
Whether you're a human or a demon in the future,

27:02.470 --> 27:04.930
only when you still wish to protect the world

27:05.030 --> 27:08.120
can you be able to do it.

27:08.660 --> 27:10.680
Go to the east of the Wilderness

27:10.740 --> 27:13.650
to ask for a dragon scale.

27:14.670 --> 27:15.730
Dragon scale?

27:15.830 --> 27:18.670
Dragon scales can repair everything,

27:18.700 --> 27:20.820
including the Cloud Light Sword.

27:20.900 --> 27:21.690
Understood.

27:22.350 --> 27:23.750
Thank you, Mr. Ying Long.

27:24.150 --> 27:25.190
However,

27:25.660 --> 27:29.300
it's not easy to get a dragon scale.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.930
Don't worry.

27:34.250 --> 27:35.310
My friend is here.

27:36.490 --> 27:37.710
We'll go together.

27:39.190 --> 27:39.870
Oh?

27:41.490 --> 27:42.490
This time,

27:43.150 --> 27:45.550
you won't ask me to get lost again, will you?

27:45.830 --> 27:46.750
Zhao Yuanzhou!

27:48.190 --> 27:49.270
Alright, alright.

27:50.620 --> 27:52.780
Bingyi once said

27:53.280 --> 27:56.570
the two most beautiful things in the world

27:56.620 --> 27:57.540
are

27:57.560 --> 28:02.490
a false alarm and a reunion after a long separation.

28:02.960 --> 28:06.110
Having a friend who truly knows you,

28:06.140 --> 28:08.530
you'll have no regrets in life.

28:08.990 --> 28:11.650
I've been looking forward

28:11.990 --> 28:15.290
to the return of my old friend.

28:15.530 --> 28:17.210
Unfortunately…

28:20.450 --> 28:23.500
You have his demon blood,

28:23.630 --> 28:25.410
so meeting you

28:25.630 --> 28:28.980
is another kind of reunion with him.

28:29.870 --> 28:32.790
At the end of my life,

28:33.110 --> 28:35.160
I got to witness

28:35.180 --> 28:38.510
the deep bond among you four.

28:39.530 --> 28:41.440
I hope in the future,

28:42.190 --> 28:43.940
you guys can still

28:44.030 --> 28:46.590
travel around the world

28:46.670 --> 28:49.070
and have adventures

28:49.190 --> 28:51.110
in the sun and under the moon

28:51.310 --> 28:52.590
so that my sacrifice

28:52.680 --> 28:55.370
to rebuild this world

28:55.390 --> 28:59.050
can be worth it.

29:01.760 --> 29:02.520
Actually,

29:03.400 --> 29:04.890
we're not four

29:06.800 --> 29:07.950
but five.

29:09.910 --> 29:11.610
We did everything we did

29:12.920 --> 29:15.030
to save the fifth person.

29:15.450 --> 29:18.860
Then I hope when you reach the end,

29:19.030 --> 29:21.200
all your hardships

29:21.350 --> 29:24.030
will turn out to be false alarms

29:24.110 --> 29:26.510
and fangs of fortune.

29:41.660 --> 29:47.680
♫Someday I'll return to my old hometown♫

29:48.510 --> 29:55.360
♫Wearing old clothes but with eyes shining bright♫

29:55.410 --> 29:57.450
♫Holding brilliance in the right hand♫

29:57.520 --> 29:59.200
♫Biting down on all panic♫

29:59.260 --> 30:00.980
♫Wiping away frost with the left hand♫

30:01.020 --> 30:02.520
♫I finally look up♫

30:02.580 --> 30:05.670
♫You're in front of me♫

30:06.590 --> 30:08.740
♫Blocking the pain♫

30:09.480 --> 30:12.800
♫Who cries with swollen eyes?♫

30:13.320 --> 30:16.120
♫With a broken heart♫

30:16.350 --> 30:19.170
♫Walking, stopping♫

30:19.240 --> 30:22.140
♫Chasing your voice♫

30:22.670 --> 30:26.240
♫I'll turn into raindrops♫

30:26.630 --> 30:29.240
♫An ancient song♫

30:29.620 --> 30:32.440
♫Running towards you♫

30:32.900 --> 30:35.810
♫Looking for you♫

30:36.990 --> 30:39.740
♫The summer cicadas also hear♫

30:40.560 --> 30:43.450
♫The winter snow also hears♫

30:43.760 --> 30:46.410
♫In a sea of people♫

30:46.610 --> 30:49.620
♫I'm holding a small wind chime♫

30:50.170 --> 30:53.630
♫I finally heard the wind say♫

30:54.030 --> 30:56.840
♫Knowing where you are♫

30:57.080 --> 30:59.880
♫It'll lead me♫

31:00.550 --> 31:03.300
♫To find you♫

31:03.920 --> 31:06.430
♫Find you♫

31:10.730 --> 31:13.380
♫Find you♫

32:31.520 --> 32:32.550
It's okay now.

32:34.280 --> 32:35.080
Alright.

32:36.220 --> 32:37.310
It's all over.

32:46.720 --> 32:47.690
It's fine now.

32:51.590 --> 32:52.980
I'm back.

34:05.750 --> 34:06.430
Zhuo.

34:08.880 --> 34:11.639
As a mortal,

34:11.750 --> 34:14.980
you're not strong enough to carry Bingyi's blood.

34:15.290 --> 34:18.350
I can't change that,

34:18.670 --> 34:22.170
but I can give you the last dragon bone of mine

34:22.350 --> 34:24.679
to help you develop an inner core

34:24.710 --> 34:26.570
and become a demon.

34:28.010 --> 34:30.030
But from now on,

34:30.230 --> 34:32.110
you can only live as a demon.

34:32.150 --> 34:34.250
You can't be a human anymore.

34:34.889 --> 34:37.300
Are you sure you want that?

34:44.670 --> 34:47.870
After experiencing everything in the illusion just now,

34:49.770 --> 34:51.570
I don't care about that anymore.

34:55.500 --> 34:56.290
However,

34:58.340 --> 34:59.620
Mr. Ying Long,

35:01.320 --> 35:03.400
the last shred of your soul

35:03.750 --> 35:05.400
is in that dragon bone.

35:06.260 --> 35:07.900
After giving it to me,

35:08.490 --> 35:09.970
will you

35:11.470 --> 35:13.250
completely disappear?

35:45.630 --> 35:46.780
Zhuo.

35:54.890 --> 35:58.260
Ying Long has long followed the way of Heaven

35:58.280 --> 36:01.000
and become the sun, moon, and stars.

36:01.170 --> 36:03.740
The last shred of my soul

36:03.910 --> 36:07.980
only exists until now because Bingyi

36:08.000 --> 36:10.450
wouldn't let me disappear back then.

36:11.420 --> 36:13.050
That guy

36:13.280 --> 36:15.790
was really stubborn.

36:16.440 --> 36:18.640
I just didn't expect

36:19.030 --> 36:22.100
to meet you after being trapped here

36:22.280 --> 36:26.510
for thousands of years.

36:42.140 --> 36:44.490
I'm very happy.

36:44.510 --> 36:46.080
Maybe

36:46.180 --> 36:48.960
this is Bingyi's blessing

36:48.990 --> 36:51.940
for you.

37:24.390 --> 37:25.310
Zhuo.

37:27.350 --> 37:28.150
Zhuo.

37:28.790 --> 37:29.820
I...

37:31.000 --> 37:32.340
I think I have it.

37:36.390 --> 37:37.510
The inner core!

37:38.470 --> 37:40.080
I mean I have the inner core now.

37:38.850 --> 37:40.080
♫In this bustling world♫

37:40.390 --> 37:41.550
Great.

37:40.570 --> 37:41.520
♫Scattered traces remain♫

37:41.770 --> 37:43.780
We're the same now.

37:41.780 --> 37:44.350
♫The riddle of time♫

37:44.260 --> 37:45.890
You've been such a bad influence on me.

37:44.840 --> 37:46.120
♫The joy and sorrow of life♫

37:46.300 --> 37:47.420
♫A few hasty lines♫

37:46.430 --> 37:47.490
Zhuo,

37:47.720 --> 37:49.180
congratulations.

37:47.850 --> 37:50.450
♫Addressing love and hate♫

37:49.220 --> 37:50.950
You've finally become a great demon.

37:50.750 --> 37:51.940
♫I wish to become the wind♫

37:52.260 --> 37:53.380
♫And transform into rain♫

37:53.440 --> 37:55.390
As a new kind of demon,

37:53.810 --> 37:56.480
♫To accompany you for thousands of miles♫

37:56.140 --> 37:58.380
do you know what your true form is?

37:56.760 --> 37:57.940
♫From the south to the north♫

37:58.320 --> 37:59.380
♫From the east to the west♫

37:59.080 --> 38:00.490
I have Bingyi's blood

37:59.770 --> 38:02.030
♫Fireworks adorn the scene♫

38:01.370 --> 38:02.690
and Ying Long's bone.

38:02.130 --> 38:05.580
♫There are countless rules in this world♫

38:04.510 --> 38:06.060
Rounding it up,

38:05.670 --> 38:07.700
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

38:06.370 --> 38:07.800
you should be a dragon.

38:07.900 --> 38:13.800
♫If heaven decides my destiny, I'll be its enemy♫

38:08.680 --> 38:09.520
Wow.

38:10.340 --> 38:11.470
So cool.

38:12.120 --> 38:13.530
I say you're a mule.

38:13.930 --> 38:17.330
♫I sing under the moon and swing my sword to the wind♫

38:15.470 --> 38:16.640
A stubborn mule.

38:17.260 --> 38:19.070
Better than being a monkey.

38:17.570 --> 38:19.570
♫Drunk on the autumn breeze beneath the bright moon♫

38:20.020 --> 38:25.550
♫Penning small verses of a grand legend♫

38:21.150 --> 38:22.040
I'm a white ape!

38:22.220 --> 38:23.750
I've told you 10,000 times!

38:23.770 --> 38:25.080
A white ape!

38:26.060 --> 38:29.340
♫You say there are countless rules in this world♫

38:26.180 --> 38:27.320
A monkey.

38:28.750 --> 38:30.670
A sly and glib monkey.

38:29.600 --> 38:31.660
♫But none can compare to "I am willing"♫

38:30.700 --> 38:32.450
I told you I'm a white ape.

38:31.990 --> 38:37.410
♫I say if fate is determined by Heaven, I'll defy Heaven♫

38:33.570 --> 38:34.740
Go away.

38:34.760 --> 38:35.640
What is this?

38:35.680 --> 38:36.940
None of your business!

38:37.980 --> 38:41.400
♫Wealth and fame turn to dust and drift away♫

38:41.630 --> 38:43.820
♫Love and hate are best left unspoken♫

38:44.020 --> 38:49.500
♫Better to have a dream before parting ways♫

38:44.620 --> 38:45.840
What on earth is it?

38:45.860 --> 38:46.740
Monkey!

38:48.460 --> 38:50.190
You're indeed a stubborn mule.

39:00.780 --> 39:03.630
Goddess, thank you. You found the Baize Token

39:03.650 --> 39:05.000
and restored the Wilderness

39:05.000 --> 39:06.980
so that I could regain my true form.

39:08.740 --> 39:10.010
Ying Lei said

39:10.860 --> 39:12.970
you're all Jiu's friends,

39:13.390 --> 39:14.470
especially

39:14.610 --> 39:17.170
his favorite person, Mr. Zhuo Yichen.

39:17.390 --> 39:19.230
He's the closest to you.

39:20.310 --> 39:22.110
Thank you for taking care of him.

39:23.600 --> 39:25.400
I failed to take good care of him.

39:26.540 --> 39:27.450
Otherwise,

39:28.030 --> 39:30.360
he wouldn't have been possessed by Li Lun.

39:30.820 --> 39:34.430
So Li Lun tried to stop us from going to the forbidden area of the Bingyi Clan

39:34.430 --> 39:35.510
because he didn't want us

39:35.510 --> 39:37.720
to repair the Cloud Light Sword.

39:38.510 --> 39:39.610
When we fought yesterday,

39:39.610 --> 39:40.670
I threw

39:40.670 --> 39:42.850
some special spice on him.

39:44.020 --> 39:45.530
No matter where he hides,

39:45.560 --> 39:46.910
I can smell him

39:46.940 --> 39:48.420
and find him.

39:50.410 --> 39:52.870
Your good nose is such a great help, Ying Lei.

39:52.890 --> 39:54.550
You're indeed a Mountain God.

39:57.780 --> 39:59.380
Mr. Zhuo,

39:59.400 --> 40:00.710
did you just praise me?

40:01.310 --> 40:02.660
It's so rare.

40:05.710 --> 40:08.420
After visiting the forbidden area of the Bingyi Clan,

40:08.420 --> 40:09.720
Mr. Zhuo

40:10.020 --> 40:12.400
became even better at sarcasm.

40:17.910 --> 40:20.010
But Goddess,

40:20.190 --> 40:22.560
the Longyu Clan has always

40:22.600 --> 40:23.950
lived in seclusion.

40:24.290 --> 40:26.100
After the Wilderness collapsed,

40:26.100 --> 40:27.840
they disappeared.

40:28.120 --> 40:29.650
I don't know where they are.

40:30.770 --> 40:32.730
I know where Princess Longyu is.

40:34.010 --> 40:35.680
Back then,

40:36.190 --> 40:39.100
she went to the mortal world against her clan's rule

40:39.710 --> 40:41.330
and killed someone there.

40:42.580 --> 40:43.590
My master

40:43.590 --> 40:46.120
imprisoned her somewhere in the Wilderness.

40:46.440 --> 40:48.360
She can't go anywhere

40:48.670 --> 40:50.600
unless summoned by Baize Goddess.

40:52.910 --> 40:55.510
The dragon scale has detoxifying properties?

41:00.720 --> 41:01.600
Who's there?

41:16.350 --> 41:18.080
So their next step

41:18.870 --> 41:21.600
is to look for the dragon scale of the Longyu Clan.

41:22.730 --> 41:24.240
In the Chongwu Camp,

41:24.440 --> 41:26.070
you watched Bai Jiu grow up.

41:26.420 --> 41:28.420
He's like a brother to you.

41:28.550 --> 41:30.580
Can you watch him die?

41:37.470 --> 41:39.480
You came to me alone.

41:39.670 --> 41:41.350
Is something bothering you?

41:42.720 --> 41:44.810
Lord Bai Yan, you're so sensitive.

41:46.850 --> 41:48.990
I want you to take a look at this for me.

41:49.470 --> 41:50.800
Is there anything wrong

41:50.970 --> 41:53.010
with the Baize Token?

41:57.220 --> 41:59.750
Why does my heart hurt

42:00.020 --> 42:01.090
like it's burning

42:01.360 --> 42:03.620
every time after I play the wooden flute?

42:03.980 --> 42:05.790
And it gets worse every time.

42:34.420 --> 42:35.740
Are you waiting for me?

42:35.350 --> 42:37.070
♫A light flickers♫

42:37.100 --> 42:39.850
♫Far in the distance♫

42:40.100 --> 42:41.170
♫Scars♫

42:41.750 --> 42:44.350
♫Nourished gently by rain♫

42:44.560 --> 42:46.110
♫The window opened by the wind♫

42:44.680 --> 42:45.740
Aren't you afraid

42:45.760 --> 42:47.480
of seeing Princess Longyu again?

42:46.130 --> 42:47.410
♫Softly sways♫

42:47.530 --> 42:50.760
♫But time slips away♫

42:51.180 --> 42:53.710
♫Hastily♫

42:53.770 --> 42:58.050
♫You wear candlelight like a robe, awaiting dawn♫

42:58.260 --> 43:02.640
♫While I cradle heartache, year after year, on and on♫

42:58.950 --> 43:01.010
Walking alone at night,

43:02.520 --> 43:03.950
one would think the darkness

43:02.960 --> 43:04.530
♫In dreams, my hometown♫

43:04.610 --> 43:06.050
goes on and on

43:04.650 --> 43:05.550
♫Lies under frost♫

43:05.610 --> 43:09.140
♫All sounds♫

43:06.470 --> 43:08.080
and has no end.

43:09.200 --> 43:11.440
But as long as a light is on,

43:09.810 --> 43:11.720
♫Are lost♫

43:12.190 --> 43:13.430
even just a glimmer,

43:14.110 --> 43:15.620
no matter how weak it is,

43:15.960 --> 43:17.520
you can follow it

43:17.950 --> 43:19.350
to find a way out.

43:19.630 --> 43:20.970
Then you'll find

43:20.990 --> 43:22.700
more and more light.

43:40.680 --> 43:41.640
You're awake.

43:49.390 --> 43:50.510
I've long

43:50.840 --> 43:52.910
left the darkness.

44:09.100 --> 44:10.640
This is Bi Fang's feather.

44:10.700 --> 44:13.230
It can send messages over thousands of miles.

44:13.230 --> 44:14.910
Keep me posted.

44:36.600 --> 44:42.350
[The Demon Hunting Squad is going to Princess Longyu for a dragon scale.]

44:50.020 --> 44:50.760
Oh.

44:51.260 --> 44:52.080
Miss.

44:52.110 --> 44:53.080
Sorry.

44:53.390 --> 44:54.490
Did I hurt you?
